    "One closed audit publication grammar binds frozen original, parsed verdict, exact head/proposal, event identity, timestamp and complete governance ACK.",
    "Each newly completed original retains its own governance ACK inside its existing business outcome; completed originals remain immutable.",
    "Current and older-head public replay use the qualified owner result and never borrow another projection. Explicit old-shape lookup prevents a proposal-identity format change from sending again.",
    "Zero-model publication and model claims mutually fence admission under the existing owner lock, including the final claim CAS and publication commit.",
    "Same-decision publication reuses its original event and timestamp; retained intent is fully validated before governance append.",
    "Existing-row governance recovery fsyncs file and all relevant containing directories before ACK without another append.",
    "Actual bounded truncated/mixed response text and partial usage are retained; missing provider stays unknown.",
    "Opus audit dispatch uses frozen request and transport identity; explicit codex_provider=False preserves the already pinned OAuth/Anthropic lane and prevents translated-model dispatch.",
    "Metabolism uses the current existing19-pin fixture owner with the same fixed-Go/VPS real native HTTP fixture; historical12pins are unchanged."
